                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00/4338: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Schurman</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-05-06T13:00:00+08:00"><hi rendition="#italic">May 6, 1922—1
                                p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received May 6—7:25 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>202. My 197, May 4th. Marines arrived at Tientsin May 5, 4 p.m.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Schurman</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
